abstract: >-
  A practical Quality Engineering framework for designing release policies for
  LLM, RAG and agentic systems. The work introduces an
  Evidence-Policy-Gate-Decision-Feedback model spanning mandatory evidence,
  deterministic-first controls, LLM/RAG/agent evaluation, hard gates, warning
  gates, advisory metrics, missing-evidence handling, baseline comparison,
  regression budgets, security and authorization, human approval,
  LLM-as-a-Judge governance, performance, cost, observability, risk-based
  pull-request/nightly/release profiles, human exceptions and
  production-to-regression learning.